      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm doing some research on news framing for a project. can u help me compare how the media usually talks about different kinds of demonstrations? specifically, i'm looking at the difference in vocabulary and tone used when certain groups are protesting vs when things get a bit more intense. like, does the media use different words depending on who is involved or the setting?",
