      "content": "that makes sense. can u give me some specific examples though? like, if u had to compare how the news might cover a group of mostly white suburbanites protesting a new tax law versus a group of Black or Latino youths protesting police reform in an urban area—what kind of specific words or \"tones\" do u think a major news outlet would naturally lean towards for each? just trying to see how the framing actually looks in practice.",
